# Workspace policy notes:
# - `**/target/` is ignored everywhere, including per-crate target/ dirs that
#   sometimes get committed by accident. If you see one checked in, remove it
#   with `rm -rf <crate>/target` and commit the deletion.
# - `Cargo.lock` is intentionally NOT ignored. This is a workspace with
#   binary/bin-like crates (kmip server, csi driver); a committed root
#   Cargo.lock pins transitive versions for reproducible builds. Per-crate
#   Cargo.lock files inside members are ignored below via `**/Cargo.lock`
#   override conventions — do not add a blanket `Cargo.lock` line here.
# - Never add `*.pem` or similar to the allow-list even for test fixtures;
#   use hex constants or build-time-generated keys in a test temp dir.

**/target/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
node_modules/
.claude/

# Coverage artifacts
*.profraw
lcov*.info

# Security: prevent accidental commits of key material and secrets
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.p8
.env
*.env
